cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If IsoSpec is useful in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: IsoSpec
abstract: >-
  A fine-structure isotopic distribution calculator for chemical formulas,
  with a C++ core and bindings for Python (IsoSpecPy) and R (IsoSpecR).
